336	/**
337	 * Keeps the people's claims on a sheet. A claim with no date is dated the sheet's today. A claim dated in a closed
338	 * period cannot be added, edited or change status. Only a DRAFT claim can be edited; a PENDING claim, waiting for a
339	 * steward to approve or reject it, is otherwise handled like an OPEN one. No claim
340	 * can be dated after the retirement date of its person. A claim with a negative amount is a correction: it must name,
341	 * by number, a SETTLED claim of the same person that it corrects, and its due has no floor and no late charge.
342	 */
343	@Service
